  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A and B are current-carrying copper wires. Both wires are perpendicular to the plane of the page and are at the same distance from point X. The magnetic field direction at X due to the currents in A and B is to the right.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>In what directions do electrons flow in wires A and B?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Electron flow direction in A</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Electron flow direction in B</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Out of the page</td>\n<td>Into the page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Out of the page</td>\n<td>Out of the page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Into the page</td>\n<td>Into the page</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Into the page</td>\n<td>Out of the page</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
